=== HOW TO QUOTE THIS ===
  A field exists for 82% of what the dev seekers state. But on a randomly
  drawn ad only 54% of their constraints have a value to compare against, and for
  HARD constraints — must-haves rather than preferences — it is 67%.
  The second number is the ceiling. Report it beside any ideal-case result, because
  no encoder and no parser can raise it: it is a property of what advertisers wrote.
